  "rule": "A control talisman that binds the foe (Bound for 2 s and 1 Slowed Time stack for 2 s) and primes your hand: the next damaging talisman art you land strikes twice (echoes at 100 % strength).",
  "hooks": ["bound", "slowed time", "talisman", "double strike"],
  "sources": ["world-depth:hoa_tinh"]
 },
 {
